From cb7ed6b33eed5268dc36ffdd28380187bd055e50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Manjaya <chrismanjaya@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 17:40:40 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Write quips in English only

Quips sit inside the English confirmation template, so the Gemini prompt
now asks for English even when the user writes Indonesian, and the
fallback quip pools are English-only. Error replies still follow the
user's language.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01U4XsZULyGL5Ja6PMPZrTHh
